CHANGES MADE ON THE WAY OUT OF THE PRIVATE WORKSPACE
----------------------------------------------------
1. Every internal serving host — the two internal server addresses and any
   port suffix — was replaced with the literal placeholder:

       serving-host

   (The internal address values are deliberately NOT restated here, so the
   released tree contains no internal network identifier at all.)
2. Absolute paths under the private home directory were replaced with the
   literal placeholder:

       <workspace>

   This covers the workspace root, the read-only target repository, the model
   cache and the launch-script directories.
3. Files under .git, .venv, scratch/, state/, jobs/, archive/, journal/,
   dockets/, .pytest_cache, __pycache__, *.lock and every file over 25 MB
   were not shipped.
4. Secret-shaped fixtures and the internal target registry
   (config/targets.toml) were not shipped.

Per-file replacement counts are in MANIFEST.json and in release/REPORT.md.
The licence and the Required Notice line are unchanged from the template of record.
